      "widgets_values": [
        "## Iris-3B: restore / upscale x4\n\nIris's restoration fine-tune as a LoRA on base Iris (or load the full upscaler checkpoint in\nLoad Diffusion Model and bypass the LoRA).\n\n- **Upscale Image By x4 (bicubic)** first: the restorer cleans up a bicubic upsample.\n- **LatentMultiply x2** is required: the sampler scales the input by (1 - sigma) = 0.5.\n- **KSamplerAdvanced**: add_noise disable, steps 2, start_at_step 1 (one step 0.5 -> 0), CFG 1,\n  euler / simple, with **ModelSamplingSD3 shift 1**.\n- Empty prompt on both sides. Trained on 1024px tiles: inputs of ~256-384px work best.\n"
      ]
    }
